## Frequently asked questions

**How long does SEO take in Bridgend?** Usually three to six months for meaningful results. Less competitive services can move sooner.

**Can you guarantee a number one ranking?** No. No honest SEO company can guarantee specific rankings. We can show you exactly what we are doing and how your visibility is changing each month.

**Do I need a new website first?** Not always. We start with a free review of your current site and tell you honestly whether it can rank as it is.

**Do you work outside Bridgend?** Yes. We cover all of South Wales and work with businesses across the UK.

